<title>BELGIUM: BRUSSELS AIRPORT'S CARGO FIGURES FOR FEBRUARY 1997.</title>
<headline>BRUSSELS AIRPORT'S CARGO FIGURES FOR FEBRUARY 1997.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freight volumes at Brussels Airport started to see a pick-up in February 1997 after a slow start to the year, compared to the same month last year.</p>
<p>The Belgian airport said freight volumes had increased by 3.8 percent to 37,463 tonnes in February 1997 compared to the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>Between March 1996 and February 1997 freight volumes rose by 4.09 percent to 452,639 tonnes, compared to the previous 12 months.</p>
<p>Traffic results for February 1997(in tonnes)</p>
<p>	     Feb 1997     Feb 1996	   pct change</p>
<p> Freight    16,796	 18,971	    -11.47</p>
<p> Express    20,667	 17,119	    +20.73</p>
<p> Mail	  1,118	  1,162	     -3.76</p>
<p> Total	 37,463	36,090	     +3.80%</p>
<p>Traffic for 12 months to end-February</p>
<p>	 Mar 96-Feb 97    Mar 95-Feb 96  pct change</p>
<p> Total	452,639	  434,858	   +4.09</p>
<p>Freight</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542-7706 Fax+-5017</p>
</text>
